Package: RancheR
Type: Package
Title: Economic Benefit of Dung Beetles to Florida Ranchers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Roisin", "Stanbrook-Buyer", email = "stanbrookr@cookman.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mahadev", "Bhat", role = "aut"),
    person("Joshua R.", "King", role = "aut"))
Description: Estimates the annual economic value that dung beetles provide to
    cattle operations by reducing the area of pasture fouled by dung pats,
    based on empirical pat-decay data from Central Florida pasture research.
    Provides the calculation functions powering the RancheR Shiny app.
